  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We didn't start from a blank page.",
      "start": 0.079,
      "end": 1.779
    },
    {
      "text": "There's an earlier project, Neufert 4.0, that handed us a great starting point a big set of Swiss apartment floor plans, and an AI model that had learned from them to draw new ones.",
      "start": 3.659,
      "end": 13.779
    },
    {
      "text": "And how it learned is going to matter for everything else I tell you.",
      "start": 14.059,
      "end": 17.0
    },
    {
      "text": "It learned by IMITATION you show it tens of thousands of examples until it can reproduce the pattern.",
      "start": 18.719,
      "end": 23.879
    },
    {
      "text": "And it left us with two gaps.",
      "start": 24.139,
      "end": 25.599
    },
    {
      "text": "The first is simple: it only knew single apartments, and we need whole buildings.",
      "start": 25.879,
      "end": 29.739
    },
    {
      "text": "The second is subtler.",
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 31.299
    },
    {
      "text": "Its plans looked like floor plans but looking like one and being a real one are two different things.",
      "start": 32.659,
      "end": 37.819
    },
    {
      "text": "You can draw something with the right feel rooms, doors, walls roughly in place that still isn't a home at all: no bathroom, say, or a bedroom with no window.",
      "start": 38.079,
      "end": 47.84
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's basically what we had.",
      "start": 48.099,
      "end": 49.479
    },
    {
      "text": "The model learned purely by copying, from a dataset that's honestly pretty small for a task this complex so what you get is less an architect and more an architect's six-year-old kid.",
      "start": 49.759,
      "end": 58.979
    },
    {
      "text": "It's seen thousands of plans and can sketch something that looks like a plan, but ask it for specific programm, modularity or structural efficiency and it will stare at you with mouth wide open.",
      "start": 60.419,
      "end": 70.04
    }
  ]
}